"<p>Esta opción determina qué día se tie pol caberu día llaboral de la "
"selmana.</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:607
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines which day will be considered as the day of the "
"week for religious observance.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Esta opción determina qué día se tien pol relixosu de la selmana.</p>"

#: localetime.cpp:614
msgid ""
"<p>This option determines whether possessive form of month names should be "
"used in dates.</p>"
